OL,3,GNEWSAThe naval site regeneration which 
OL,4,Auncovered 360 skeletons                
OL,6,FChatham Maritime, which sits beside the
OL,7,Fhistorical dockyard on a picturesque   
OL,8,Fwaterfront setting, is rife with       
OL,9,Fhistory.                               
OL,11,FIt forms part of what was the royal    
OL,12,Fnaval docks which closed in 1984,      
OL,13,Fresulting in about 17,000 job losses   
OL,14,Facross Chatham Dockyard and supporting 
OL,15,Findustries.                            
OL,17,FTwo years later, government agency     
OL,18,FEnglish Estates was appointed to       
OL,19,Fredevelop a large portion of the former
OL,20,Fnaval site into what is now Chatham    
OL,21,FMaritime, a 350-acre site with homes   
OL,22,Fand leisure facilities.                
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
