OL,3,GNEWSAThe naval site regeneration which 
OL,4,Auncovered 360 skeletons                
OL,6,FWhile redeveloping an area which also  
OL,7,Fneeded huge decontamination, project   
OL,8,Fmanager David Allen and his team       
OL,9,Fdiscovered the bodies of 362 prisoners 
OL,10,Fof war who died in the early 19th      
OL,11,FCentury.                               
